# Python environment
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Local evaluation harness — test scripts and generated outputs stay local,
# except permanent regression tests explicitly excepted below. Mirrors
# workspace-knowledge/.gitignore's pattern exactly, including the `tests/*`
# (not bare `tests/`) form: git cannot re-include individual files with `!`
# inside a directory excluded via a bare `dir/` pattern, since it never
# recurses into an already-excluded directory to evaluate per-file negations.
# That bare-`tests/` form is what this file had until 2026-08-06, and is the
# actual mechanical reason every previously-run agent-memory test suite
# ("22 passed" per mcp-governance.md / 09-mcp-architecture-decision.md) was
# never committed despite being real, working tests — not merely "forgotten,"
# but structurally unignorable under the old pattern even if someone had
# tried to except them.
tests/*
!tests/conftest.py
!tests/test_server.py
!tests/health_comparison.py
!tests/test_cross_server_health_comparison.py
!tests/test_write_gate.py
!tests/test_write_provenance.py
!tests/test_write_memory.py
